  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 15.2625 − [5.2 + 0.25 × (4.78 − 1.5 × 3.02)]\n\n⇒ 15.2625 − [5.2 + 0.25 × (4.78 − 4.53)]\n\n⇒ 15.2625 − [5.2 + 0.25 × 0.25]\n\n⇒ 15.2625 − [5.2 + 0.0625]\n\n⇒ 15.2625 − 5.2625\n\n⇒ 10\n\n**So, the simplified form of the equation is 10.**",
